                  "text": "Mahendo 20:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi wakati uredza, usiyale koti rangu roriricha kpwa Karipo hiko mudzi wa Tirowa. Piya unirehere vitabu vyangu, haswa vira vya chingo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.13",
