          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niriphokala nadzikanira kano ya kpwandza kotini, takuna hata mutu mmwenga ariyekala uphande wangu. Atu osi aniricha machiyangu, ela navoya Mlungu aaswamehe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Mlungu wakala phamwenga nami na achinipha nguvu, ili niweze kutangaza chikamilifu ujumbewe kpwa atu osi asio kala Ayahudi, aphahe kuusikira. Phahi wanitivya ili nisiolagbwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Bwana andanitivya na chila hendo ra uyi, na anitsukule salama hadi mlunguni kusagala na atue. Mlungu naatogolwe hata kare na kare. Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
